WEBVTT

00:01:57.774 --> 00:02:01.755
and a soft reassurance
that they're not alone

00:02:01.779 --> 00:02:03.321
and this is their movement, too.

00:02:05.042 --> 00:02:07.492
I'd tell them that we're stronger together

00:02:07.516 --> 00:02:12.038
and that this is a movement
of survivors and advocates

00:02:12.062 --> 00:02:14.791
doing things big and small every day.

00:02:16.708 --> 00:02:19.082
And more and more people
are joining this movement

00:02:19.106 --> 00:02:20.326
every single day.

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:21.541
That part is clear.

00:02:22.765 --> 00:02:25.135
People are putting
their bodies on the line

00:02:25.159 --> 00:02:28.709
and raising their voices to say,
"Enough is enough."